<title>SPAIN: BASKETBALL-LJUBLJANA BEAT BARCELONA IN EUROLEAGUE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-LJUBLJANA BEAT BARCELONA IN EUROLEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a EuroLeague basketball group C match on Wednesday: Barcelona (Spain) 70 Ljubljana (Slovenia) 71 (halftime 37-35).</p>
